  "notes": "FORMATION: {総|そう} (total, overall) + {計|けい} (count, calculate).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {総計|そうけい}で: in total\n- {総計|そうけい}する: to total up, to calculate the sum\n- {総計|そうけい}{金額|きんがく}: total amount\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {総計|そうけい}: grand total (formal, comprehensive)\n- {合計|ごうけい}: total, sum (more common in everyday use)\n- {累計|るいけい}: cumulative total (accumulated over time)\n- {総額|そうがく}: total amount (specifically for money)",
